      title: 'Vitest: Architecture & Why It Displaced Jest',
      summary: 'Vitest reuses your Vite config and transform pipeline, runs tests in parallel workers with native ESM, and ships Jest-compatible APIs — eliminating the dual-build problem where Jest needed its own Babel/CJS world that diverged from the app build.',
